            "text": "[deadlock-breaker: exploration wedged at (15, 9) (all reachable frontiers border solid rock). Auto-searched 20x for a hidden passage. If still no new exit, `move_to` a DIFFERENT visible tile or `search` more — the way down is likely behind a hidden wall.]\n[Pathing to (14,9): 1 steps.]\n\n=== JOURNAL ===\nObjective: Descend as deep into the dungeon as you can and survive; ultimately win the game (retrieve the Amulet of Yendor and escape).\n\n=== MAP ===\n\n\n\n\n  ---------------\n  |$............|#\n  |<............|#\n  |.............|#\n  |........d....|#\n  |............@|##########\n  -----------.--- ###  ---+-\n             ###### # |....+\n                    ##-....|\n                      |....|\n                       ....|\n                        ....\n                        ...|\n                        ----\n\n\n\n\n\n\n=== STATUS ===\nHP: 12/16  AC: 6  Dlvl: 1  Turn: 163  XP: 1  $: 1  Pos: (15,9)\nCharacter: valkyrie (human, neutral)\n\n=== INVENTORY ===\n  $: a gold piece\n  b: a +1 long sword (weapon in hand)\n  c: a +0 dagger (alternate weapon; not wielded)\n  d: an uncursed +3 small shield (being worn)\n  e: an uncursed food ration\n\n=== ADJACENT === N=. NE=| E=| SE=- S=- SW=- W=. NW=.\n\n=== HINT === No `>` visible. Nearest way out is an open doorway at (13,10) — `move_to(x=13, y=10)`. (5 exits visible.) [This same suggestion has now been made 15 turns running and the situation has not changed — it is not working. Try a different frontier, a different exit, or `search` for a hidden passage.]\n\n=== VISIBLE FEATURES === stairs UP at (3,6); door (open/gap) at (13,10), (22,12), (27,15); door (closed) at (26,10), (27,11); gold at (3,5)\n\n=== VISIBLE MONSTERS === little dog at (11,8), 4 steps W [PET - don't attack]\n"
          }
        ]
